{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/771773f7b4a51b5f168a1357d9fba6b1.avif?t=1761407957\" width=756 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Idlenture\u00a0</strong>is a pixel art idle dungeon crawler where you play as a bear exploring endless dungeons, fighting monsters, collecting loot, and unlocking powerful upgrades. Descend deeper, grow stronger, and build your perfect setup to conquer every floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of the journey through the depths. Descend through the first 20 balanced dungeon floors, face the first boss, and uncover the rhythm of exploration and survival. This demo includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 balanced dungeon floors to explore and conquer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first boss fight </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique skills to master </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 collectible items to find and equip </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 attributes to upgrade and customize your build </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 distinct monsters with different abilities and stats</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Defeat monsters</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/15e2cfb50bc0654159866eab91f5933b.poster.avif?t=1761407957\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/15e2cfb50bc0654159866eab91f5933b.webm?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/15e2cfb50bc0654159866eab91f5933b.mp4?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your hero tear through waves of monsters with fast, automatic combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Unleash skills</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/25278f59ba416f21b2cbf49b969d9066.poster.avif?t=1761407957\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/25278f59ba416f21b2cbf49b969d9066.webm?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/25278f59ba416f21b2cbf49b969d9066.mp4?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate powerful abilities to clear rooms and crush enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Collect and upgrade gear</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/ba596f199c01ca5d3ac819812b9f64dd.poster.avif?t=1761407957\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/ba596f199c01ca5d3ac819812b9f64dd.webm?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114020/extras/ba596f199c01ca5d3ac819812b9f64dd.mp4?t=1761407957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory, gather powerful loot, and upgrade your favorite items into legendary sets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse